UID:stanford_campus-law-10003522-1793191500-1793196000@law.stanford.edu-20
 26-10-28T12:45:00-07:00@local-events
DESCRIPTION:Under the second Trump administration\, immigrants and nonciti
 zens have faced deportation and detention on an unprecedented scale\, acce
 lerating the convergence of immigration enforcement and the criminal justi
 ce system. How can lawyers and immigrant rights advocates use legal mechan
 isms\, policy tools\, and media narratives to combat these threats? \nJoin
  us for a conversation on law\, advocacy\, and media strategy moderated by
  Professor Chacón and featuring Laura Hernandez\, Executive Director of F
 ree\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/event/resisting-cr
 immigration-detention-the-prison-to-ice-pipeline-and-shifting-narratives/
