 ow a mother of three\, her quiet suburban life is shattered when DNA evide
 nce links her to the infamous cold case of “Geauga’s Child\,” and
  she is arrested for murder and sentenced to life in prison.  After the
  screening\, the filmmaker Jessica Earnshaw and SLS Professor Rabia Belt w
 ill participate in a\n\nAges: All ages\nSource: https://law.stanford.edu/e
